Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}In the garden of dreams, hope blossoms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}bright; each dawn breathes secrets of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}Sunlight dances on petals of gold; love’s
