Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}Birds thread sweet melodies through the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}air — nature’s canvas, vibrant and fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:28.19,Dark,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}But shadows pool in the well of night:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:31.84,Dark,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}whispers of despair, a chilling sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.77,Dark,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}Darkness consumes, devours the light;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:39.06,Dark,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}echoes of sorrow, an endless plight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:44.29,Dark,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}A haunting silence, a hollowing hush — in
