Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:48.70,Dark,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}Fair and vibrant?
