Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}Through the air, the melody keels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:01:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,280)}Old grows the warmth; it loosens its hold.
